  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Model Interruption Notifier",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nContinue a DSH conversation after a failed model run, automatically or after confirmation in a corner reminder. Automatic continuation is enabled by default and submits the exact text `继续` through the original conversation's normal prompt path.\n\nThe plugin also provides a live switch in its detail page. It follows the DSH theme and excludes delegated subagents."
    },
    {
      "section": "Documentation",
      "text": "- [Installation, behavior, privacy, and development](docs/guide.md)\n- [GitHub releases and dsh-market listing](docs/publishing.md)\n- [MIT license](LICENSE)\n\nThe plugin uses DSH extension services and ships no game logic, company integrations, account configuration, or conversation data. Continuing a conversation uses its existing model provider and context; the plugin adds no separate reporting endpoint."
    }
  ],
